<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased, lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY   *07.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP UP   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    11.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 07.MAY.97 THEN STEPS-UP TO 4.75 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		 CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 1157</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
